\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Thevenin-equivalent source ($V_{th}=\qty {8}{\volt }$, $R_i=\qty {663}{\ohm }$) driving a variable decade-box load $R_L$, used to trace the load-power curve.}}{2}{figure.1}%
